{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運輪椅劍擊項目，港隊在混合花劍團體賽銅牌賽不敵韓國，無緣獎牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n港隊由鄺遠興、陳㬢、湯雅婷和余翠怡上陣，在八強擊敗東道主日本隊之後，四強不敵國家隊，轉戰銅牌賽迎戰韓國隊。全場雙方比分拉鋸，並互有領先，最終以17:20落敗。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:05.103568+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:18:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T12:18:27.853223+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:01.751989+00:00","content_hash":"d5312333100d95f2b115c47fe79642df4276238fc969efe8b8427af7bdfff979","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}